Q: Create class of Book and print Title Author name and price
package book_details;

class Book {
    String title;
    String authorName;
    double price;
    
    public void displayBookInfo() {
        System.out.println("The title of book is: " + title);
        System.out.println("The author of book is: " + authorName);
        System.out.println("The price of book is: " + price);
    }
}

public class Book_Details {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Book book1 = new Book();
        book1.authorName = "R.S. Aggarwal";
        book1.title = "Aptitude & Reasoning";
        book1.price = 500.789;
       
        book1.displayBookInfo();
    }
}

OUTPUT:
The Title of Book is: Aptitude & Resoning
The author of Book is: RS Aggarwal
the price of Book is: 500.789

